Matt J. L. Goebel <goebel@emunix.emich.edu>
Len Senetza <len@helix.net>
mortimer@physics.uq.edu.au
Matt Moore <moore@shemp.bucks.edu>
Robert L. McMillin <rlm@syseca-us.com>
Tom Smith <smith@alum.mit.edu>
