3.2G		3.2C		setld

4.0		3.2C		installupdate
4.0		3.2D-1		installupdate
4.0		3.2D-2		installupdate

4.0A		3.2G		installupdate
4.0A		4.0		installupdate

4.0B		4.0		installupdate
4.0B		4.0A		installupdate


	Hope this helps



						Bob Fedorchak

