for giving me some ideas on how to fix
my printing problem.  The important point was that I shouldn't have any
filters in my printcap since ghostscript's output was already in the
PCL required by the printer. Either of the gs devices cdj850 or cdj550
will work for this printer.

Here is my final printcap entry:

	hpcolor|lp4|sbnslo color printer:\
		:af=/usr/adm/lp4acct:\
		:lf=/usr/adm/lp4err:\
		:lp=/dev/lp0:\
		:mx#0:\
		:sb:\
		:sd=/usr/spool/lpd4:\
		:sh:

